  "sourceAssessment": {
    "basis": [
      "jinshu:053:s0063–s0065 describes the deposition, armed removal of the crown prince’s household and 考竟謝淑妃及太子保林蔣俊. zizhitongjian:083:s0193–s0196 narrates the same removal with 王氏 and three sons, followed by 殺太子母謝淑媛及虨母保林蔣俊. Exact personal name, female household title, companion victim Xie and distinctive execution establish one woman.",
      "jinshu:053:s0017 supplies the favored 蔣美人 bearing a son; s0053 names 蔣 in the forged oath, whose drafting frame s0045–s0057 is explicit. That attributed forged text is not treated as a genuine assertion of her participation. The later full 蔣俊 title remains the direct identity anchor."
    ],
    "notes": [
      "Complete current singleton members jinshu:053:p027 and zizhitongjian:083:p051; all 52 Chinese units, five governing blocks, 13 owned claims, eight mentions and two inbound mother-child claims read, with both English fields at owned/inbound anchors.",
